Hi,

In xhj.dtx in template description 'hyphenation' keys
'hyphen-discourage-boolean' and 'hyphen-encourage-boolean' currently
share exactly the same description, which I think is wrong.  Attached is
a small patch.

Best regards,
Stephan Hennig


Index: xpackages/galley/xhj.dtx
===================================================================
--- xpackages/galley/xhj.dtx	(Revision 624)
+++ xpackages/galley/xhj.dtx	(Arbeitskopie)
@@ -1069,7 +1069,7 @@
 %
 %   \TemplateKey{hyphen-encourage-boolean}{s}
 %      {Sets penalties for breaking a line at a discretionary to a
-%      higher value. Only relevant if \key{hyphen-enable-boolean} is
+%      lower value. Only relevant if \key{hyphen-enable-boolean} is
 %      set to true.}
 %      {none}
 %

